xmassage.net/post/how-massage-can-naturally-support-healthy-blood-sugar-my-client-s-real-life-example\"   },   \"description\": \"An educational discussion of massage, stress and blood glucose, including a client observation and references from Matrix Massage & Bodywork.\",   \"url\": \"https://www.matrixmassage.net/post/how-massage-can-naturally-support-healthy-blood-sugar-my-client-s-real-life-example\",   \"image\": {     \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",     \"url\": \"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/e4cc43_d0e2ce166ac4480f9e56033f543f2af1~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_392,h_261,al_c,q_80/e4cc43_d0e2ce166ac4480f9e56033f543f2af1~mv2.jpg\",     \"width\": \"392\",     \"height\": \"261\"   },   \"publisher\": {     \"@type\": \"Organization\",     \"name\": \"Matrix Massage & Bodywork\",     \"url\": \"https://www.matrixmassage.net\"   } }","custom":false,"disabled":false}],"settings":{"preventAutoRedirect":false,"keywords":[]}},"richContent":{"nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"07vpi8","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Did you know massage therapy can do more than relax tight muscles? It can also support healthy blood sugar levels — and I recently saw this in action right in my studio!","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"t4xd210","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"aqt7n11","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"One of my clients came in wearing a continuous glucose monitor (CGM) on their arm. This tiny device tracks blood sugar in real-time, minute by minute. After a full massage session focused on stress relief and muscle tension, we checked their monitor together — and their glucose levels had noticeably dropped during the session.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"o2q6i13","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ligeq14","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"✨ Why is this good?","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"a8i1q16","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"It means their body shifted from fight-or-flight mode into rest-and-digest mode — where it can naturally regulate blood sugar more efficiently.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"tg1iw21","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9im3i22","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"✅","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"7vem924","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"How Does Massage Help Lower Blood Sugar?","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ubjxy27","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"l83e128","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Massage isn’t a substitute for medical care, but research shows it can have a meaningful impact on how your body handles glucose:","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"f4lqh31","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"gh3mx32","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"1️⃣","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"4at4234","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Reduces Stress Hormones","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"zy8eg37","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"c1dqh38","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Massage reduces cortisol and adrenaline, stress hormones that trigger your liver to release more glucose into your bloodstream. [1]","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"qskki41","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"q6axa42","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"2️⃣","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6kos344","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Boosts Insulin Sensitivity","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6ufln47","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"vh0em48","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Relaxation from massage may help your body’s cells respond better to insulin, which moves sugar out of your blood and into your muscles for energy. [2]","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"f4yoy51","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"xf09a52","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"3️⃣","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"7xmxi54","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Improves Circulation","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"r413t57","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"vz3fj58","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Increased blood flow helps deliver oxygen and nutrients to cells — supporting healthier glucose metabolism. [3]","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ib0wv61","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"4xpg762","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"4️⃣","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"al78n64","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Supports the Nervous System","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"flnfz67","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"skrtf68","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Massage activates the parasympathetic nervous system, your body’s “rest and digest” mode, which naturally lowers blood sugar and promotes balance. [4]","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"a288k73","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"c1px774","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"✅","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"exypw76","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"What the Research Says","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dyw9p79","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"BULLETED_LIST","id":"m02xp80","nodes":[{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"cy66y81","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"w8q6u82","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"A 2016 systematic review found ","decorations":[]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"massage therapy ","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://www.matrixmassage.net/massage-therapy-services-salem-wi","target":"BLANK","rel":{"noreferrer":true}}}},{"type":"UNDERLINE"}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"helped lower fasting blood glucose in people with type 2 diabetes. [5]","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"hyyxx84","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"o816i85","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Another study found that abdominal massage helped regulate insulin and blood glucose in patients with diabetes. [6]","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}}]}],"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"rve4192","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"248fg94","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"A Word of Caution","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"3e3rj97","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"19ag798","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Massage can gently lower glucose, which is usually a good thing — but clients who take insulin or other glucose-lowering medications should know this can add to the effect. If you’re managing diabetes, it’s wise to:","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dcizm100","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"BULLETED_LIST","id":"e7se2101","nodes":[{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"vshl0102","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"edbgw103","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Check your levels before and after your massage","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"rw2do105","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"p4o3j106","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Have a small snack if needed to keep your blood sugar stable","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}}]}],"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"4el7w113","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"d0699115","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"My Takeaway as a Massage Therapist","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dueq3118","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"l7ul0119","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Seeing this happen in real-time with my client’s CGM was amazing. It’s a great reminder that massage therapy isn’t just about relaxing muscles — it’s about supporting your whole system.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"po3mr124","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"7hkbp125","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"💡","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"0lc6i127","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"If you’re managing stress, blood sugar, or just want to help your body rebalance naturally — massage therapy can be part of your wellness toolkit.","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textSty